      *      !   ! Removed -In-To-Contr-No.                      !    ! 00590020
      *150699!HLR! Added two fields: -O-Amount                   !LG10! 00600018
      *280499!HLR! Work-Status removed                           !LG10! 00610018
      *150299!HLR! New copy area                                 !LG10! 00620012
      *################################################################*00630000
      *                                                                 00640000
         03  R115ICA0-Contract-Amount.                                  00650000
      *                                                                 00660000
           05  R115ICA0-Version-No              Pic  X(08).             00670000
             88  R115ICA0-Version                    Value '20000619'.  00680025
      *                                                                 00690000
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*00700000
      *                                                                 00710000
           05  R115ICA0-Qualification.                                  00720000
      *                                                                 00730000
             10  R115ICA0-In-Action             Pic  X(16).             00740000
               88  R115ICA0-In-Get-1st               Value 'GET-1ST'.   00750000
               88  R115ICA0-In-Get-Next              Value 'GET-NEXT'.  00760000
               88  R115ICA0-In-Select                Value 'SELECT'.    00770000
               88  R115ICA0-In-Insert                Value 'INSERT'.    00780000
               88  R115ICA0-In-Update                Value 'UPDATE'.    00790000
               88  R115ICA0-In-Delete                Value 'DELETE'.    00800000
      *                                                                 00810000
      * There are several key-fields, which may be used differently     00820000
      * depending on the need.                                          00830000
      *                                                                 00840000
      * In-Table must be set whatever the desired action is.            00850016
      *                                                                 00860016
      * For Insert, use the Data area for all fields.                   00870015
      *                                                                 00880015
      * For Select, Update and Delete, use:                             00890015
      *     - Fin-Inst-No or Fin-Inst-ID                                00900000
      *     - Contract-Type                                             00910000
      *     - Contract-No                                               00920000
      *     - Currency                                                  00930000
      *                                                                 00940000
      * For cursor (Get-1st / Get-Next), use:                           00950000
      *     - Optional: Fin-Inst-No or Fin-Inst-ID                      00960000
      *     - Optional: Contract-Type                                   00970000
      *     - Optional: Contract-No                                     00980021
      *     - Optional: Currency                                        00990000
      *                                                                 01000000
             10  R115ICA0-In-Key.                                       01010000
      *                                                                 01020000
               15  R115ICA0-In-Table-Version    Pic  X(16).             01030017
                 88  R115ICA0-In-Actual              Value 'ACTUAL'.    01040016
                 88  R115ICA0-In-Work                Value 'WORK'.      01050016
      *                                                                 01060016
      *        It is optional wether you use Fin-Inst-No or Fin-Inst-ID.01070000
               15  R115ICA0-In-Fin-Inst.                                01080000
                 20  R115ICA0-In-Fin-Inst-No    Pic  X(18).             01090009
                 20  R115ICA0-In-Fin-Inst-ID    Pic S9(18)       Comp-3.01100000
      *                                                                 01110000
      *        Contract-Type and -No is mandatory for                   01120000
      *        Select/Update/Delete.                                    01130015
               15  R115ICA0-In-Contract.                                01140000
                 20  R115ICA0-In-Contract-Type  Pic  X(03).             01150000
                 20  R115ICA0-In-Contract-No    Pic S9(07)       Comp-3.01160000
      *                                                                 01170000
      *          Temporary, as this field is still in use.              01180020
                 20  R115ICA0-In-From-Contr-No  Redefines               01190023
                                                R115ICA0-In-Contract-No 01200024
                                                Pic S9(07)       Comp-3.01210020
      *                                                                 01220020
      *        Currency is mandatory for Select/Update/Delete.          01230015
               15  R115ICA0-In-Currency         Pic  X(03).             01240000
      *                                                                 01250001
      * When performing a Get-1st-call one may ask for the total        01260000
      * number of rows complying with the qualification.                01270000
      *                                                                 01280000
             10  R115ICA0-In-Code-Count         Pic  X(10).             01290000
               88  R115ICA0-In-CC-Count              Value 'COUNT'.     01300000
