             10  R115ICA0-Min-Pct-Tolerance     Pic S9(04)       Comp.  01490007
             10  R115ICA0-Max-Pct-Tolerance     Pic S9(04)       Comp.  01500007
             10  R115ICA0-Prev-O-Amount         Pic S9(14)V9(03) Comp-3.01510018
