      *                                                                 01570007
      * The following accumulators are only relevant when performing    01580000
      * Get-1st or Get-Next.                                            01590000
      * Row-No starts on 1 when doing Get-1st, and increases by 1 for   01600000
      * each Get-Next.                                                  01610000
      * Total-Rows is set when doing Get-1st, but ONLY if the           01620000
      * In-CC-Count is set. The field will tell you how many rows       01630000
      * that complies with your qualification.                          01640000
      *                                                                 01650000
             10  R115ICA0-Out-Accumulators.                             01660000
               15  R115ICA0-Out-Row-No          Pic S9(11)       Comp-3.01670000
               15  R115ICA0-Out-Total-Rows      Pic S9(11)       Comp-3.01680000
